# Split into their own repos (CloudForgeCI/cloudforge-manager,
# CloudForgeCI/cloudforge-manager-deployment) — no longer part of cfc-core's reactor or
# dependencyManagement (see root pom.xml). Kept as working-tree checkouts here for local dev
# convenience, but never tracked by cfc-core's own git history.
/cloudforge-manager/
/cloudforge-manager-deployment/